                             "PJM price caps, FERC delays or state data-center moratoria limit power prices and new deals.",
                             "Uprate execution, nuclear outages or Calpine integration costs ($73M after tax in Q3) disappoint.",
                             "The price breaks below the $228.63 52-week low, a support level."
